WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.795
Allan didn't like high places.

2
00:00:10.796 --> 00:00:13.192
Allan didn't climb ladders.

3
00:00:13.193 --> 00:00:16.281
"No way!"

4
00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:19.497
Allan didn't go on the slide.

5
00:00:19.498 --> 00:00:22.345
"Too scary!"

6
00:00:22.346 --> 00:00:25.739
Allan never jumped off the diving board.

7
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.447
"Not me!"

8
00:00:28.448 --> 00:00:31.860
Allan never climbed tall trees.

9
00:00:31.861 --> 00:00:34.580
"Wait a minute. What's that?"

10
00:00:34.581 --> 00:00:38.179
Allan's cat was in a tree.

11
00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.395
It was not a tall tree.

12
00:00:40.396 --> 00:00:45.760
But Allan thought it was a very tall tree.

13
00:00:45.761 --> 00:00:48.886
"I can't leave my cat in the tree."

14
00:00:48.887 --> 00:00:52.861
How could Allan get his cat?

15
00:00:52.862 --> 00:00:54.906
Allan called for help.

16
00:00:54.907 --> 00:00:57.779
"Somebody help! Help!

17
00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:00.916
Please get my cat!"

18
00:01:00.917 --> 00:01:06.791
No one answered. Nobody helped.

19
00:01:06.792 --> 00:01:11.433
Allan cried. Then Allan's dad came outside.

20
00:01:11.434 --> 00:01:16.239
"Allan, why are you crying?" he said.

21
00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:19.473
"Dad, my cat is up in the tree.

22
00:01:19.474 --> 00:01:24.165
I can't get it." Allan said.

23
00:01:24.166 --> 00:01:25.403
"Climb up here."

24
00:01:25.404 --> 00:01:30.607
Allan slowly climbed onto his dad's shoulder.

25
00:01:30.608 --> 00:01:34.109
"Are you still scared?" Allan's dad asked.

26
00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.411
"No," Allan said.

27
00:01:37.412 --> 00:01:40.234
Allan got the cat and held it.

28
00:01:40.235 --> 00:01:41.774
"Don't worry, kitty.

29
00:01:41.775 --> 00:01:47.394
You're safe now."

30
00:01:47.395 --> 00:01:50.752
"Thanks, Dad!" Allan said.

31
00:01:50.753 --> 00:01:53.162
He looked at the tall tree.

32
00:01:53.163 --> 00:01:58.777
"Hmmm. That tree is shorter now!"
